5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm Kenji. I'm really excited to play this game with you all.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"Hello. I am Victoria. I prefer to observe before I speak, but I am here.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,Toshio here. I will focus on logic and consistency. Let's proceed carefully.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,George. I have played many games. We should trust our instincts but verify facts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi! I'm Sakura! I love mysteries! Who is the sneakiest one here?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I think we should be friendly. If we help each other, we will win together.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,Friendliness is a mask. I will watch for inconsistencies in your stories.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Early trust is dangerous. We need to establish a baseline of behavior.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,I agree with Toshio. Calmness is key. Do not rush to judgment yet.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, scary! But I like it! @Victoria, are you the wolf in disguise?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, don't be so quick to accuse! We are all friends here, right?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, your eagerness is noted. It could be genuine or a distraction.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, your eagerness to bond is also a pattern. I am observing both.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,Let us not start with accusations. We have no information yet. Stay calm.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, I'm just curious! @Toshio, you seem so serious. Are you hiding something?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,I just want to have fun! I trust my friends. Let's see what happens tonight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I will keep my cards close. The night will reveal more than words.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I will wait for the data. No conclusions until the first result is in.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,George,,I will rely on my experience. Let us see who acts nervously tomorrow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Okay! I'll be watching! Goodnight everyone! I hope you sleep well!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
